  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intern Partn microbicides</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Intern Partn microbicides</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPM plays a highly relevant role today as a product developer solely focusing on ARV based compounds and in its rote as a partner to leading pharmaceutical farms. IPM has sought to strategically expand and advance the pipeline of compounds available for investigation as potential microbicides by prioritizing drugs with human safety and HIV treatment efficacy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med forskningsst&#xF6;det &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka IPMs m&#xF6;jligheter att forts&#xE4;tta med sina omfattande kraftanstr&#xE4;ngningar f&#xF6;r att f&#xE5; fram fungerande microbicider mot HIV.IPM har skapat partnerskap och samarbetar med olika akt&#xF6;rer.IPM har ing&#xE5;tt avtal med ett flertal l&#xE4;kemedelsf&#xF6;retag f&#xF6;r att f&#xE5; tillg&#xE5;ng till antiretrovirala substanser med olika verkningsmekanismer f&#xF6;r att kunna skapa 2:a generationens microbioci.</narrative>
  </description>
